+
+## Workflow State Diagram
+
+```
+                    +------------------+
+                    |     PENDING      |<------------------+
+                    +--------+---------+                   |
+                             |                             |
+              confirmBooking |                             | cancelBooking
+                             v                             |
+                    +------------------+                   |
+                    |    CONFIRMED      |                   |
+                    +--------+---------+                   |
+                             |                             |
+              completeBooking |                             | cancelBooking
+                             v                             |
+                    +------------------+                   |
+                    |    COMPLETED     |                   |
+                    +------------------+                   |
+                             ^                             |
+                             |                             |
+                             +-----------------------------+
+                             |           |
+                             | cancelBooking (REJECTED)
+                             v           v
+                    +------------------+
+                    |    CANCELLED     |
+                    +------------------+
+                             ^
+                             |
+                             +
+                             |
+                    (REJECTED: cannot cancel again)
+```
+
+---
