+## Test Case 1: Confirm pending booking successfully
+
+Endpoint:
+
+PUT /api/bookings/{bookingId}/confirm
+
+Path parameter: bookingId = 2
+
+Initial state: PENDING
+
+Expected result:
+- Booking status changes from PENDING to CONFIRMED.
+- updatedAt is set to current timestamp.
+
+Actual result:
+- **PASSED** - Status changed to CONFIRMED.
+- Response: `{"bookingId":2,"status":"CONFIRMED","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T23:54:56.805902"}`
+
