+## Notes for Group Report
+
+The booking workflow module manages the lifecycle of bookings through status transitions. The system enforces strict rules to ensure data integrity and prevent invalid state changes.
+
+**All 10 test cases passed successfully**, validating:
+
+1. **Status Transition Rules**:
+   - PENDING → CONFIRMED (via confirmBooking)
+   - CONFIRMED → COMPLETED (via completeBooking)
+   - PENDING/CONFIRMED → CANCELLED (via cancelBooking)
+   - COMPLETED → CANCELLED (REJECTED)
+   - CANCELLED → CANCELLED (REJECTED)
+
+2. **Slot Management**:
+   - When a booking is cancelled (PENDING or CONFIRMED), the slot is automatically released back to AVAILABLE status.
+   - When a booking is created, the slot status changes to BOOKED.
+
+3. **Timestamp Management**:
+   - createdAt is set when booking is created.
+   - updatedAt is updated whenever booking status changes (confirm, cancel, complete).
+
+4. **Error Handling**:
+   - All invalid operations return appropriate error messages.
+   - Non-existent bookings return 404.
+   - Invalid state transitions return 400 with descriptive messages.
+
+**Business Rules Summary**:
+| Action | From State | To State | Slot Effect |
+|--------|------------|----------|-------------|
+| confirmBooking | PENDING | CONFIRMED | None |
+| cancelBooking | PENDING | CANCELLED | Slot → AVAILABLE |
+| cancelBooking | CONFIRMED | CANCELLED | Slot → AVAILABLE |
+| completeBooking | CONFIRMED | COMPLETED | None |
+
+**Invalid Transitions (Rejected)**:
+| Action | From State | Error Message |
+|--------|------------|---------------|
+| confirmBooking | CONFIRMED | Only PENDING booking can be confirmed |
+| confirmBooking | CANCELLED | Only PENDING booking can be confirmed |
+| confirmBooking | COMPLETED | Only PENDING booking can be confirmed |
+| cancelBooking | CANCELLED | Booking has already been cancelled |
+| cancelBooking | COMPLETED | COMPLETED booking cannot be cancelled |
+| completeBooking | PENDING | Only CONFIRMED booking can be completed |
+| completeBooking | CANCELLED | Only CONFIRMED booking can be completed |
+| completeBooking | COMPLETED | Only CONFIRMED booking can be completed |
